   "source": [
    "# PPP (patent–paper pair) — Citation-Trend Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "Face-validity figures for the PPP trend outputs, rendered inline: coverage, the **citation-age profiles**\n",
    "(paper→paper and patent→paper by years since publication; patent→patent by years since grant), per-pair\n",
    "citation totals, and examiner vs non-examiner shares.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Inputs\n",
    "```\n",
    "notebook/PPP/output/ppp_paper_trend.parquet   # paperid, patent, pub_year, cite_year, yrs_since_pub, p2p, pat2p_examiner, pat2p_non_examiner\n",
    "notebook/PPP/output/ppp_patent_trend.parquet  # paperid, patent, grant_year, cite_year, yrs_since_grant, pat2pat_examiner, pat2pat_non_examiner\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "7a0cf6b7",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-28T17:28:32.515103Z",
